<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>에러페이지</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #e3f2fd;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      color: #0d47a1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .message {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #d32f2f;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    pre {
      background-color: #fbe9e7;
      color: #c62828;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      max-width: 90%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-align: start;
    }

    .home-btn {
      background-color: #64b5f6;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 20px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .home-btn:hover {
      background-color: #42a5f5;
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🚨 에러가 발생했습니다</h1>
  <div class="message"><%= message %></div>
  <pre><%= error.stack %></pre>
  <button class="home-btn" onclick="location.href='/'">🏠 홈으로 이동</button>
</body>
</html>
